SUMMARY:Summer Venture Studio Preview Day @ Ion District
DTSTAMP:20260803T120110Z
DTSTART:20260805T153000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/6jbyeu9f \nCheck-in begins at 3
	:30 PM. Event begins at 4:00 PM. \nBe among the first to see what’s next 👀
	\n​Join us for the inaugural Summer Venture Studio Preview Day\, where thi
	s year’s cohort of ambitious student founders will pitch the ventures they
	’ve spent the summer building.\n​Hosted by the Ion District and in partner
	ship with Rice Alliance\, SVS Preview Day is both a showcase and a celebra
	tion of Houston’s innovation community. \n​Meet founders\, connect with fe
	llow entrepreneurs\, investors\, mentors\, and supporters\, and help us ce
	lebrate the next generation of student innovators at Rice. \n​Meet the 202
	6 SVS Cohort!\n​Actile Technologies\n​Founder: Barclay Jumet \n​Actile dev
	elops wearable smart fabrics that communicate critical information through
	 the language of touch\, helping operators’ eyes and ears stay focused on 
	their environment in national defense and other demanding settings. \n​DHI
	 Tech\n​Founders: Dev Sanghvi\, Madhuvani Thatiparti\, Aneesh Thatiparti \
	n​DHI Tech is developing a plug-and-play edge AI layer for surveillance ne
	tworks that makes every camera a smart device\, covering 25-plus safety\, 
	compliance and security use cases out of the box. \n​Kairos Health\n​Found
	ers: Adhira Tippur\, Sanjana Kavula\, Tanush Chintala\, Aditya Jain \n​Kai
	ros have developed an AI-powered patient intake platform built specificall
	y for independent dental practices. \n​Lucero Health\n​Founders: Halbert K
	im\, Rohan Dharia \n​Lucero connect patients to supplemental resources\, t
	urning non-medical needs into actionable care beyond the clinic via a digi
	tal platform. \n​MedIQ Health\n​Founders: Suran Somawardana\, Jacob Lei\, 
	Patrick Bednarz \n​MedIQ is developing hardware and software solutions tha
	t help asthma patients and their doctors better manage their condition. \n
	​Codene\n​Founders: Adam Towner\, Saul Brauns \n​Codene are building the A
	I platform for go-to-market engineering. They Codene discovers ideal custo
	mers\, executes personalized outreach and accelerates the journey from lau
	nch to revenue. \n​Vantage\n​Founders: Gavin Firestone\, Nolan Connolly \n
	​Vantage have developed an AI motion coach that uses computer vision to de
	liver instant\, actionable feedback on exercise technique and programming.
	 \n​Magma Health\n​Founder: Ramtin Shahzanian \n​Magma clones real compani
	es into high-fidelity RL environments. \n​Coop\n​Founders Adithiya Balagur
	u\, Arnav Bhalla \n​Coop are building an early respiratory disease detecti
	on system for poultry farms using AI to analyze audio feeds collected from
	 poultry houses. \n​Learn more \n​About Summer Venture Studio\n​Summer Ven
	ture Studio (SVS) provides an immersive three-month experience where Rice 
	student entrepreneurs receive $15\,000 in non-dilutive funding\, individua
	lized mentorship\, workspace and access to an extensive network of experie
	nced founders\, investors\, and industry experts. \n​Since launching in 20
	23\, SVS has become one of Rice’s premier pathways for translating student
	 innovation into high-growth companies. More than half of participating ve
	ntures have gone on to raise pre-seed or seed financing\, while alumni com
	panies have earned acceptance into some of the world’s most competitive ac
	celerators programs\, including Y Combinator and Tech Stars. \n​For more i
	nformation\, visit Lilie Summer Venture Studio! \n​About Liu Idea Lab for 
	Innovation & Entrepreneurship (Lilie)\n​The Liu Idea Lab for Innovation an
	d Entrepreneurship (Lilie) is the home for entrepreneurship and innovation
	 at Rice University. As the center for entrepreneurship on campus\, Lilie 
	runs courses and co-curricular programs to help develop students\, researc
	hers\, faculty\, and alums into entrepreneurs for life.\n\nhttps://iondist
	rict.com/event/summer-venture-studio-preview-day-ion-district/\n\nFrom Ion
	 District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/summer-venture-studio-preview-day-ion-dis
	trict/
LOCATION:Ion – Forum Stairs\, 4201 Main St.\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United
	 States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT3H
END:VEVENT
