SUMMARY:Jesus Benavente: NUESTROWORLD
DTSTAMP:20260803T120110Z
DTSTART:20260813T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Opening Thursday\, August 13\, 2026 | 6 – 8 pm Gallery Hours: T
	hurs – Sat\, 12 – 6 pm\nNUESTROWORLD is a satirical solo exhibition by Bro
	oklyn-based artist Jesus Benavente\, conceived of as a visual album and im
	mersive “amusement park.” This project features interconnected works unfol
	ding across the gallery and city\, collectively highlighting Houston’s cyc
	lical history of ambition\, folly\, and heartbreak. The title NUESTROWORLD
	 is a play on Astroworld and uses Spanglish to create the phrase “The Worl
	d Is Ours.” The project draws inspiration from popular events that mark sp
	ecific eras of Houston’s history\, such as the opening of the world-famous
	 Astrodome and Astroworld Park in the late 60’s\, Selena’s iconic Rodeo pe
	rformances in the 90’s\, and the folklore surrounding the 1836 capture of 
	Santa Anna during the Battle of San Jacinto as part of the Texas Revolutio
	n. Together\, they build a story\, a world developed over time that unders
	cores sacrifice\, instills resilience\, and highlights a Texas attitude of
	 “come and take it.”  \nOpening ReceptionThursday\, August 13\, 6 – 8 pmAr
	tist and Curator Talk: 6:45 pm \nClosing PartyFriday\, September 11\, 2026
	\, 6 – 8 pm7 pm: special performance by CTS Trio – Queen of Tejano & Latin
	 Tribute \nARTIST BIO:\nJesus Benavente is a visual artist based in Brookl
	yn\, New York\, and born in San Antonio\, Texas. Benavente earned an MFA f
	rom Rutgers University and attended Skowhegan School of Painting and Sculp
	ture. Recent exhibitions and performances include Reception Rome\, Italy\;
	 the Whitney Museum of American Art\, New York\; Queens Museum\; LTD Los A
	ngeles\; Performa 13\, New York\; Acre Projects\, Chicago\; Chinati Founda
	tion\, Marfa\; the Neuberger Museum of Art\, Purchase\, NY\; Shin Museum o
	f Art\, South Korea\; Vox Populi\, Philadelphia\; and Socrates Sculpture P
	ark\, New York. \nWebsite: http://jesusbenavente.netInstagram: @testotesto
	3 \n \n\nhttps://diverseworks.org/event/jesus-benavente-nuestroworld/\n\nF
	rom DiverseWorks
URL:https://diverseworks.org/event/jesus-benavente-nuestroworld/
LOCATION:DiverseWorks\, @ 5601 B Navigation Blvd & Various Locations\, 5601
	 B Navigation Blvd\, Houston\, TX\, 77011\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:diverseworks
CATEGORIES:DiverseWorks
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT768H
END:VEVENT
